Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:57:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: Map network drive
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Refs #153. "…" > Map network drive... opens in the details pane: a folder
address (smb://server/share) and an optional name. Finish remembers the drive
in Lapin's own dev.lapinux.Explorer settings and connects it. A mapped drive
always shows under This PC (page and left pane), connected or not; opening one
that isn't connected connects it first, and a whole server (smb://server) is
browsed. "…" > Disconnect network drive forgets the drive shown and
disconnects it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016CkhomYUp7uVySJk724Amq
